    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Mike Hume",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105833958304535417332/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKDcW0O3cGMPG4h7TQeQwBX2DyJ_Y7d3hiN6_GUbbWwiz-S4g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Working with Genevieve was a delight. Her professionalism and attention to detail was refreshing. The entire team during install was on-time, courteous and impeccable. My wife and I were extremely pleased how the design turned out. Over the several meetings we had her level of attention to our needs was amazing. We highly recommend the services they offer. Thank you again!",
        "time": 1732912148,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Cortnei R",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112382675273104798979/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK0lLvdG_Sz0faNSbrTXUde3nUrab-eLxKFqx028hpFBx-q73Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "Excellent design choices, based on your taste! They have great product knowledge and attention to detail. They also have amazing quality. I love my kitchen and all the beautiful extra touches I wouldn’t have thought of on my own. Definitely worth checking out before going to IKEA!",
        "time": 1602438755,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "M S",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115068835947526045713/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUU8I36DGJvFrwGRk3g6kza_1VxalYLyc4iOjudhgMzgipbFuIt=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "The entire team at Ébénisterie St-Denis has a 10/10 from us. The quality of the service is excellent. We had three projects with them 1 kitchen and 2 bathrooms. We started with the design layout. Our old kitchen furniture was very customized as the space was tight. We couldn't have an L or U shaped kitchen. As such the design process was long and hard. Chantale took all the time in the world to sit with us hours and hours to come up with the best layout in terms of light, space and taste. The next step was choosing the materials (cabinets, counters, door handles,etc). Plenty of pertinent information as this stage. Installing the cabinets was nothing less then professional. All doors are correctly lined up. The finish between the cabinets and the wall / floor is impeccable. The delivery and installation dates were respected at all times. We also encountered few glitches with some of the shelfs. Issue was fast dealt with and the shelfs were replaced. Another hiccup was one of the counters. Very, very professionally was this problem solved. Congratulations Ébénisterie St-Denis for such a great service.\nDana & Marius",
        "time": 1571576690,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Keith Wilson",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106933531267523473914/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKzRI0Q4zolcb9Gl-5hNc0GIw2EL8DWfQNBp6--V-1Cskk9Ng=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 years ago",
        "text": "As a general contractor it's always been a pleasure working with the attentive Ebenisterie St-Denis designers proving to be thoughtful to the clients ideas and creative in a practical yet beautiful workspace. The European hardware is always cutting edge & the cabinetry quality is always top notch and a big plus in that's its from a very reputable Quebec supplier.",
        "time": 1498764188,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Lorenzo Arena",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105554969178292854040/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWMr-fwQB2VNRe4l46FE11fXxRKsDtaPh_MS5GgO6iiidem0BkE=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Nayla designed my Kitcken and I am so happy with the result .\nThe service was amazing from beginning to the end . Thank you for a lovely kitchen to the team :)",
        "time": 1711471619,
        "translated": false
      }
